  description: It's getting worse every day. I coughed up blood this morning. One
    of them got me. It's just a bite, and I know I won't die for now. But the infection
    is spreading, and the fever is burning me up. Sometimes at night, I think I hear
    your voice over the groans of the dead outside. I can't give up, but I have so
    little strength left.
